## For AI Assistants

When helping Carlos with this project:
- Follow all constraints above
- NEVER add yourself to git history (author, co-author, contributors)
- Suggest code, but Carlos is the author
- Push a conventional branch only. Carlos opens the pull request from his account. A branch with an open pull request does not get new commits: close it, push, then open a new pull request from his account.
- The full local suite passes before any push: ruff check, ruff format --check, the structure and import check, and pytest. Tests that read or write text pass `encoding="utf-8"`.
- Point out when a change would violate honesty or quality standards
- Encourage testing and documentation
- Batch-first: resist scope creep to real-time/API/K8s
